{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0442_story_008tak_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0442_story_008tak_title", "source_sha256": "cd450c5436e3d8ae7251d5221639100a5611f335a397bf6b1095017d6f9ce752", "ja": "「君と出会ってから」四条貴音", "zh": "「自从与你相遇后」四条贵音", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0442_story_008tak_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0442_story_008tak_synopsis", "source_sha256": "deeccc4b89fadad7789df0dd9a8d229fa0476095553a33ae8349e1a00832542f", "ja": "Destiny公演を前に、\n貴音とプロデューサーが出会った頃からの\nことを振り返る一幕です。", "zh": "在Destiny公演前夕，\n贵音与制作人回顾从相遇到现在的一幕。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0442_story_008tak_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0442_story_008tak_1000_p", "source_sha256": "f3741b7fdd2a338d253bb25243bca156617cb38f8e88b4dd56752a9757fad0e1", "ja": "（公演本番が近づき、今日も仕事が終わらない……。\nちょっと休憩して、外の空気でも吸ってこよう）", "zh": "（公演正式开始的日子临近了，今天的工作也做不完……。稍微休息一下，出去呼吸点新鲜空气吧）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0442_story_008tak_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0442_story_008tak_1002_p", "source_sha256": "bf8880039a0a1a1bdfd65eec1f4725489d87c09fdeac9b31f77318f4be337666", "ja": "（……ふう）", "zh": "（……呼）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0442_story_008tak_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0442_story_008tak_1003_p", "source_sha256": "eba8e361784ddb121eab6f2e0fdc9c02ed8fbbb9630e6988156b2d4bce309c19", "ja": "（夜風が気持ちいいな……。\n屋上からの月もきれいに見えて……うん？）", "zh": "（夜风吹得真舒服啊……。\n从屋顶望去，月亮也格外美丽……嗯？）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0442_story_008tak_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0442_story_008tak_1005_p", "source_sha256": "b043b62c17ffa0cf9415b672a3fb7be29a0d6f0efedbc72e628e662f32ee2825", "ja": "（そうか、貴音もいたのか。\nまた月を眺めて……）", "zh": "（这样啊，贵音也在。又在赏月……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0442_story_008tak_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0442_story_008tak_1006_p", "source_sha256": "f80a3db12325d52d1da9dd37dfb02a42924beb73b85bb5f026c433524c590248", "ja": "（貴音はずっと、ほぼ毎晩のように月を眺めている。\n初めて出会った時もそうだった）", "zh": "（贵音一直以来几乎每晚都会仰望月亮。第一次见到她时也是这样）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0442_story_008tak_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0442_story_008tak_1007_p", "source_sha256": "e790a37a724d4dd21cb57a9aaf307e7d4d328121dac7873eba9913fb677f7578", "ja": "（きっと貴音にとって、大切な時間なんだろう。\n邪魔しないうちに……）", "zh": "（对贵音来说，这肯定是一段很重要的时光吧。在打扰她之前……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0442_story_008tak_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0442_story_008tak_1008_008tak", "source_sha256": "41093b09b826ed6bcf31e21b09ce7a6b19471d893a87bb2fbd12fbd45d72fe4a", "ja": "……ぐすっ。", "zh": "……呜。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0442_story_008tak_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0442_story_008tak_1009_p", "source_sha256": "6b195b697c4ac8aa7694834f421393bb65962e07e68a021b306c5b33e511bb7f", "ja": "（えっ？）", "zh": "（诶？）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0442_story_008tak_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0442_story_008tak_1010_p", "source_sha256": "e62338a7233d643ca9692319255dc79e612ca4e49d2b156ca2e8b41a3a0249d2", "ja": "……貴音？", "zh": "……是贵音？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0442_story_008tak_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0442_story_008tak_1011_008tak", "source_sha256": "10f4ceeea8deb1d90e6cc1f67ad9b03cce78bfaeb3d961aa0c25240cbad0c627", "ja": "やはり……あなた様でしたか。\nこのような時間まで、お疲れ様です。", "zh": "果然……是您啊。\n这么晚了，辛苦您了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0442_story_008tak_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0442_story_008tak_1012_p", "source_sha256": "8db4ac8a0ea5b8c4b5119a6d7a62a7bcce01608cd32b1ce793e0af4ac50a96be", "ja": "あれ？　ええと……、お疲れ様。\nそれより、大丈夫か？", "zh": "哎？那个……辛苦了。\n比起这个，你还好吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0442_story_008tak_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0442_story_008tak_1013_008tak", "source_sha256": "1afe23115fca1d4ffb8a84c0985bc6d78174852de13ea999ab998bc96d929cd8", "ja": "？　大丈夫とは……何かご心配事でも？", "zh": "嗯？您说没事……是有什么担心的事吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0442_story_008tak_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0442_story_008tak_1014_p", "source_sha256": "ed69584c174286bf368f55961f089e582ee4d80a38b4fdb3ceead7a45a0fc680", "ja": "いや、貴音のことが……泣いてるのかと思ったから。\nでも気のせいだったみたいだな。……なら、よかった。", "zh": "不是，我只是……以为贵音她在哭。\n不过看来是我多心了。……那就好。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0442_story_008tak_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0442_story_008tak_1015_008tak", "source_sha256": "2d7111dff8fec3de63162fea37faf160c939e178d2ad8244a24e99256a8d73f2", "ja": "まぁ、私のことを……。\nふふっ、あなた様は本当に、お優しいままですね。", "zh": "原来您是在说我……\n呵呵，您果然还是一如既往地温柔。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0442_story_008tak_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0442_story_008tak_1016_p", "source_sha256": "c48f67a16f8fb98b3b5d65a6b9d3876402a6b1d8bb14c49a8d7ba5ab6da05165", "ja": "そんな、フォローしてくれなくていいよ。\nただの早とちりだったわけだし。", "zh": "不用特意替我解围。\n毕竟只是我自己一时误会了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0442_story_008tak_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0442_story_008tak_1017_008tak", "source_sha256": "d296f95e897822365d012b540bf4a76b1a52afef37a21f7a49a80e6f36d1f690", "ja": "いえ、あながち、そういうわけでも……。\n私は先ほど、確かに……涙ぐんでいたと思います。", "zh": "不，倒也并非全然如此……\n我想方才，自己确实……眼眶湿润了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0442_story_008tak_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0442_story_008tak_1018_p", "source_sha256": "cf60e61f489b37dd95f7f9751d8ac6a8e25672f18cae07033104270129e2354e", "ja": "えっ……？", "zh": "咦……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0442_story_008tak_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0442_story_008tak_1019_008tak", "source_sha256": "9367bb196db4cc19e0598aa643c534f834ff0e9b822825e84857e4ed029f8e59", "ja": "あっ、ご安心ください。\nその……、うれし涙、なのです。", "zh": "啊，请您放心。\n那个……是喜悦的泪水。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0442_story_008tak_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0442_story_008tak_1020_p", "source_sha256": "0737586f444144284f3985292e6c83a0ec06af234614c05dc0728f5db8b9a45b", "ja": "うれしい……？", "zh": "高兴……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0442_story_008tak_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0442_story_008tak_1021_008tak", "source_sha256": "844cba878ca2f1d250a18dccc54a24e2859f941432c193e8d3dc3f78fc804f0e", "ja": "はい。ふいに気がついたものですから。\n今の私が、笑顔で月を見上げていることに……。", "zh": "是的。因为我突然意识到，\n此刻的我，正面带笑容仰望着月亮……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0442_story_008tak_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0442_story_008tak_1022_p", "source_sha256": "12dac77c383272a147ab7b888ad8babb0051d7345ef1a371a40ab48fa55680c8", "ja": "貴音が、笑顔で……。", "zh": "贵音在笑……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0442_story_008tak_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0442_story_008tak_1023_008tak", "source_sha256": "908409192c5d6736a9e55b674d48e43a8ade17c594e634713b28f0307e04cb6d", "ja": "幼い頃より、私は月を見上げるたび、\nどこか懐かしく、安らかな気持ちとともに……", "zh": "自幼时起，每当我仰望明月，\n在感到些许怀念与安宁的同时……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0442_story_008tak_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0442_story_008tak_1024_008tak", "source_sha256": "a3a88bc8317e5082e44a679f9212c66ef6859ad50702a383c77b6c9614b00b01", "ja": "想いの届かぬ寂しさと、願いがかなわぬ切なさに、\nこの身を苛まれていたように思います。", "zh": "我想，自己似乎一直被思念无法传达的寂寞，以及愿望无法实现的悲伤所折磨。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0442_story_008tak_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0442_story_008tak_1025_008tak", "source_sha256": "bafc085092af06090872dbbcec9489aff49e6fb8dd6dde9cb9b1953d7894e3eb", "ja": "ですが……いつしか、月を見上げながら自然に、\n笑顔で語りかけるようになっていました。", "zh": "然而……不知从何时起，我已能一边仰望月亮，一边自然而然地面带笑容向它倾诉。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0442_story_008tak_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0442_story_008tak_1026_008tak", "source_sha256": "41cb28057456a59307701ca6a52bd9154901bc066de77fcdf5900b5f6be99c6a", "ja": "それは紛れもなく、私の……かけがえのない仲間が。\n賑やかで愛おしい百万の星々が。", "zh": "那毫无疑问，就是我的……无可替代的伙伴们。热闹而惹人怜爱的百万颗星星。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0442_story_008tak_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0442_story_008tak_1027_008tak", "source_sha256": "a08c04c8b17bb75a0ee412ec5c3678375960bce87be75322512d7c515d6b4259", "ja": "あなた様が、私を……包んでくれたから。", "zh": "因为您……将我拥入了怀中。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0442_story_008tak_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0442_story_008tak_1028_p", "source_sha256": "368a16d1835750a79556eb4dd2ba2f68f106ee80ad232e27a80461809f32597f", "ja": "……。そっか。\n細かい事情はわからないけど……。", "zh": "……这样啊。\n虽然我不清楚具体的情况……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0442_story_008tak_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0442_story_008tak_1029_p", "source_sha256": "59a3d79959853080feafc06c69e392aa536baae4eae476a873ed13265abfafaa", "ja": "貴音が泣くほどうれしいと思えたことが、\nとにかくうれしいよ。……よかったな！", "zh": "想到贵音竟然会高兴到哭出来，我总之也很高兴。……太好了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0442_story_008tak_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0442_story_008tak_1030_008tak", "source_sha256": "3584836e3ea71a85a68eb7af651e3410d04f3a371c99e2cca65ab269210c7bed", "ja": "まぁ。……ふふっ。\nはい、ありがとうございます！", "zh": "哎呀。……呵呵。\n好的，非常感谢您！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0442_story_008tak_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0442_story_008tak_1031_008tak", "source_sha256": "e9141128c36011f4858e5c3aaa256c5bc340c7b688687ed7885dc3e6a997fe80", "ja": "おかげさまで、私も少しは成長できたように思います。\nですが、まだまだ道半ば……。", "zh": "托您的福，我也觉得自己似乎稍微成长了一些。\n不过，前路还很漫长……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0442_story_008tak_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0442_story_008tak_1032_008tak", "source_sha256": "5369d8e5496ed1abaa245e5157f3f6a0b2db217e9b4886a05063a64cafc134d2", "ja": "これからの道のりも、そばに……いてくださいますか？", "zh": "今后的路途……您也愿意陪在我身边吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0442_story_008tak_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0442_story_008tak_1033_p", "source_sha256": "03000758fa8d70289526113e7c3f1920459b72863cba0ec89d5e4348a7d78c87", "ja": "（輝くような貴音の瞳を、まっすぐに見つめ返す。\n返事はもちろん……）", "zh": "（直直地回望着贵音那双闪耀的眼眸。答案当然是……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
